通信协议设计

消息格式 (JSON-RPC 2.0 风格)

cn-codex 发送请求:

{
  "id": "req-001",
  "method": "document.insertText",
  "params": {
    "text": "Hello World",
    "position": "cursor"
  }
}

WPS 插件回复:

{
  "id": "req-001",
  "result": { "success": true, "insertedChars": 11 }
}

WPS 插件主动通知 (无 id):

{
  "method": "event.documentChanged",
  "params": { "documentName": "report.docx" }
}

